 "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe length of the radius is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CX & =\\sqrt{{(0-\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right))}^{2}+{(-3-\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right))}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{\\frac{5}{2}}^{2}+\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{17}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, our circle is generated by the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-\\left(- \\frac{5}{2}\\right))^{2}+(y-\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right))^{2} & =\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{34}}{2}\\right)^{2} \\\\ (x+\\frac{5}{2})^{2}+(y+\\frac{3}{2})^{2} & =\\frac{17}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186548222 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "062949d4-45ca-52b1-8e26-e95a3b3399e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}+y^{2}=16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548199} {:answer/id #uuid "838d8f22-b133-5a9a-9070-3921cde4026e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+8)^{2}+(y-3)^{2}=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548241} {:answer/id #uuid "b0c2ee35-4f09-5bc6-8652-d1e8b39120d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}+y^{2}=5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548251} {:answer/id #uuid "e59ffebd-7fab-5921-a0f7-3769151e88a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-4)^{2}+y^{2}=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548260} {:answer/id #uuid "ec11c63c-d96a-5b15-a5a9-48063db15199" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}+y^{2}=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186548263}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ec11c63c-d96a-5b15-a5a9-48063db15199" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}