eb969b62d91" :question/problem "![](images/0d/0de50141c687bd36fc592bfdaa0d755c8838da9a81c81188ebfc6b408320405b.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the circle given above?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFrom the picture, we see that our circle is centered at $C(1,5)$ and the radius of the circle is $r=\\frac{9}{2}.$ Therefore, the equation of the circle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-1)^{2}+(y-5)^{2} & =\\left(\\frac{9}{2}\\right)^{2} \\\\ (x-1)^{2}+(y-5)^{2} & =\\frac{81}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186637312 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c594c02c-c397-57da-a205-899c7fbe80c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-0)^2+(y-6)^2=36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637014}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c594c02c-c397-57da-a205-899c7fbe80c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-0)^2+(y-6)^2=36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637014} :answer-field/id #uuid "3fa32c2e-a622-50b6-ad57-dc94905f4d59" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186637137}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "c56259e8-dc21-5058-a348-756bdb1eced7" :question/math-academy-id "q-167948" :question/problem "Write the equation of this circle in the form $(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The equation of a circle with radius $r$  centered at the point $(a,b)$ in rectangular coordinates in standard form is\n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, the circle is centered at $(0,6)$ and the radius of the circle is $r=6$, so\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-0)^{2}+(y-6)^{2} & ={6}^{2} \\\\ {x}^{2}+(y-6)^{2} & =36.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the equation of the circle in rectangular coordinates is \n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+(y-6)^{2}=36.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643388 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1356c0de-675c-53e6-bf67-44ac2692b25f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+{y}^{2}=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643383} {:answer/id #uuid "13aded89-25c8-5cf3-b987-9c2e34f974b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+{y}^{2}=36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643384} {:answer/id #uuid "227a97f1-e658-50df-9596-01060e02acd7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643385} {:answer/id #uuid "ec5b337e-6942-5526-92fe-237d2bc2a972" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}^{2}+(y+2)^{2}=36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643410} {:answer/id #uuid "ffc91714-694b-52ec-816a-92c5b6b7bb11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+2)^{2}+{y}^{2}=36" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643416}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1356c0de-675c-53e6-bf67-44ac2692b25f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}+{y}^{2}=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643383} :answer-field/id #uuid "0736b23c-04f6-5dab-8c85-e9d4e0e9277d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643382}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3c7668ec-cfca-52ff-af3f-e1d2d9a49172" :question/problem "![](images/be/be3016908a3fba5debdfa3ac512e1a8871916fa68d2b9852d82b8fbfc7ea75f5.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the circle given above?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFrom the picture, we see that our circle is centered at $C(2,0)$ and the radius of the circle is $r=2.$ Therefore, the equation of the circle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+(y-0)^{2} & ={2}^{2} \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+{y}^{2} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643393 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31992e60-67cb-5d39-b91d-1aba811f0c89" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}+(y-7)^{2}=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643386} {:answer/id #uuid "559b2eb8-6f4b-574b-a17d-356799d726d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+7)^{2}+(y+4)^{2}=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643392} {:answer/id #uuid "b294e8f5-f4ff-57bc-b46f-70e63d26d7b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-7)^{2}+(y+4)^{2}=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643403} {:answer/id #uuid "d7048ab3-f30e-58b6-808c-6969a2d29fbb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+7)^{2}+(y+4)^{2}=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643407} {:answer/id #uuid "ed060176-70cc-5a04-9484-38900a307bae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}+(y-7)^{2}=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643411}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ed060176-70cc-5a04-9484-38900a307bae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+4)^{2}+(y-7)^{2}=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643411} :answer-field/id #uuid "6092d7ca-931b-5852-b07b-0450b60b69f4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643394}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "5609b857-bacb-547d-8fe0-6d23d2a5