lection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643390}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "82279fa1-b5b5-56c6-a1d8-90d749cb7b17" :question/problem "![](images/36/36b49f689c735249b87414fb3d994d31ec84479082bd8b1b4a1dce70d9050b74.png)\n\nWhat is the equation of the circle given above?" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of a circle with radius $r$ centered at the point $(a,b)$ is \n\n$$\n(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFrom the picture, we see that our circle is centered at $C(-4,3)$ and the radius of the circle is $r=3.$ Therefore, the equation of the circle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2} & ={r}^{2} \\\\ (x-(-4))^{2}+(y-3)^{2} & ={3}^{2} \\\\ (x+4)^{2}+(y-3)^{2} & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186643404 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "51e1a691-a946-5e3c-bcbe-74061873903d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+5)^{2}+{y}^{2}=81" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643391} {:answer/id #uuid "9863c856-18c5-54c7-a3d1-ff041e93f432" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{x}^{2}+(y+5)^{2}=9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643398} {:answer/id #uuid "9bf83dfb-4649-5a4d-9d24-abaaa7d195e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-5)^{2}+{y}^{2}=9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643399} {:answer/id #uuid "f346e27d-19bb-5629-8d23-8e246e118ef7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x-5)^{2}+{y}^{2}=81" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643412} {:answer/id #uuid "fd92d0c6-9b4e-5412-8485-bd40836d02d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(x+5)^{2}+{y}^{2}=9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186643414}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fd92d0c6-9b4e-5412-8485-bd40836d02d8" :